First, we looked at the effects of ~ 250 μA on zoospore attachment, using the usual assay based on confocal microscopy, and observed a significant reduction in both local and global EF configurations. Interestingly, no difference was detected in this case between the two configurations (Fig. 6A,B).Figure 6
